      "purpose": "Defines a base class that manages a set of listener functions, providing subscribe/unsubscribe and overridable lifecycle hooks for reactive notification patterns.",
      "summary": "This file implements a generic Subscribable class used as a foundation for observer-style state containers. It maintains a Set of listener callbacks, binds the subscribe method to the instance, and exposes a subscribe API that returns an unsubscribe closure. Subclasses can override empty onSubscribe and onUnsubscribe hooks to react to listener changes. The class is synchronous and manages internal state only.",
